{
  "_comment": "Haret Al-Yasmin community server layout. build_server.py creates whatever is missing and refreshes forum tags/guidelines. Tag names max 20 chars, max 20 tags per forum. 'moderated' tags can only be set by staff (Manage Threads). Explained in docs/community/DISCORD_SERVER.md.",
